big/5486622690af17111c7f99e98731c070.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=840 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/f38330e2c7ab5bbc61ad9270068ebb53.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/f38330e2c7ab5bbc61ad9270068ebb53.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=856 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/0454c4736b9f7e37b9c2765cfd72232d.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/0454c4736b9f7e37b9c2765cfd72232d.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=876 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/eaf6c741bdffc95908e17bb89996c5eb.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/eaf6c741bdffc95908e17bb89996c5eb.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=868 /></span><strong><i><u>PAINTBALL MADNESS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/0805a912272e0e875bd751ae6b208cd5.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/0805a912272e0e875bd751ae6b208cd5.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 SPLASH HARD. MOVE FAST. RULE THE COLOR CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just paintball — it’s a <strong>high-speed showdown in a world bursting with color</strong>.<br> Dive into <strong>wild, chaotic battles</strong> where every second is loud, bright, and full of action. One move can change everything. One shot can put you on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or squad up — <strong>Paintball Madness™</strong> drops you into <strong>vibrant, color-soaked battlegrounds</strong> where only the fastest, sharpest players come out on top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>EXPLORE THE MADNESS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/a635f864d9ad11fff00d3e673da41a36.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/f38330e2c7ab5bbc61ad9270068ebb53.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/f38330e2c7ab5bbc61ad9270068ebb53.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=856 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into bold, color-packed arenas designed for chaos. From open-air layouts to tight corners and vertical routes, every zone fuels fast movement, tactical pushes, and non-stop paint-splattering fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/4d260e27449ad3069d1ce1220f650ae1.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/1d3b572acc584237bd96c4cb7d8f740a.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/1d3b572acc584237bd96c4cb7d8f740a.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take aim your way — lock in with first-person for precision shooting or switch to third-person for better map awareness. Play your style. Shift mid-fight. Always stay in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/f251383f5e52935ac5fb36e458b5bba4.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/5486622690af17111c7f99e98731c070.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/5486622690af17111c7f99e98731c070.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=840 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay and outmaneuver with dynamic moves like dash, double jump, and a quick shield. Use them to escape ambushes, rush opponents, or turn the tide in close encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/533d753de2fed1d14f74264820114d91.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/eaf6c741bdffc95908e17bb89996c5eb.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/eaf6c741bdffc95908e17bb89996c5eb.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every elimination drops coins. Pick them up, stack them up, and redeem later for skins and cosmetics on our website.<br> Your skill turns into style — the better you play, the better you look.<br> <strong>And soon, coins will matter even more — use them in tournaments and private matches to raise the stakes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕒 One Rule: Outscore Everyone Before the Game Ends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the arena with one mission: <strong>get the most eliminations and outscore your opponents</strong>. <br> No camping. No hiding. No mercy. <br> <strong>Move fast, shoot smart, and stay on top</strong> if you want to win.<br><br><strong>🔥 FAST FUN FOR EVERYONE — BUT ONLY ONE WINS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Quick Matches</strong> – No warm-ups. No waiting. Just jump in and battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Easy to Play, Tough to Master</strong> – Great for kids, teens, and seasoned shooter fans. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>FPS or TPS – Your Call</strong> – Swap between first- and third-person at any moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Abilities That Flip the Fight</strong> – Dash, double jump, and shield your way to victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃 <strong>No Time to Hide</strong> – Keep moving or fall behind. This game doesn’t reward campers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Outplay, Outshoot, Outscore</strong> – Fast decisions and sharper aim make the difference. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥇 <strong>Live Leaderboards</strong> – Track eliminations in real-time and fight to stay on top. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ DON’T PLAY SAFE. PLAY TO WIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping won’t help. Hiding won’t save you. <br> You want that <strong>#1 spot</strong>? Then you’ve got to fight for it. <br> <strong>Outplay. Outshoot. Outspeed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 COMING SOON</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Tournaments</strong> – Compete in <strong>high-stakes events</strong> to prove you're the best and earn exclusive rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛏️ <strong>Private Rooms</strong> – Create custom matches just for your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎫 <strong>Game Pass System</strong> – Unlock exclusive cosmetics, rewards and host or join private matches with game passes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌍 Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available in <strong>English</strong>.<br> More languages are coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏁 THE CLOCK IS TICKING. THE PAINT IS FLYING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast. Shoot smart. Rule the chaos.</strong> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/7787e9d60ae5e9d56cbfa6e24b04715a.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/7787e9d60ae5e9d56cbfa6e24b04715a.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=848 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/1d3b572acc584237bd96c4cb7d8f740a.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/1d3b572acc584237bd96c4cb7d8f740a.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/01cce8f92d6c38ad4c052505d5ac155c.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor