ical routes, every zone fuels fast movement, tactical pushes, and non-stop paint-splattering fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/4d260e27449ad3069d1ce1220f650ae1.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/1d3b572acc584237bd96c4cb7d8f740a.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/1d3b572acc584237bd96c4cb7d8f740a.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take aim your way — lock in with first-person for precision shooting or switch to third-person for better map awareness. Play your style. Shift mid-fight. Always stay in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/f251383f5e52935ac5fb36e458b5bba4.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/5486622690af17111c7f99e98731c070.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/5486622690af17111c7f99e98731c070.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=840 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay and outmaneuver with dynamic moves like dash, double jump, and a quick shield. Use them to escape ambushes, rush opponents, or turn the tide in close encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/533d753de2fed1d14f74264820114d91.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/eaf6c741bdffc95908e17bb89996c5eb.avif?t=1786711410\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras_big/eaf6c741bdffc95908e17bb89996c5eb.avif?t=1786711410 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every elimination drops coins. Pick them up, stack them up, and redeem later for skins and cosmetics on our website.<br> Your skill turns into style — the better you play, the better you look.<br> <strong>And soon, coins will matter even more — use them in tournaments and private matches to raise the stakes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕒 One Rule: Outscore Everyone Before the Game Ends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the arena with one mission: <strong>get the most eliminations and outscore your opponents</strong>. <br> No camping. No hiding. No mercy. <br> <strong>Move fast, shoot smart, and stay on top</strong> if you want to win.<br><br><strong>🔥 FAST FUN FOR EVERYONE — BUT ONLY ONE WINS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Quick Matches</strong> – No warm-ups. No waiting. Just jump in and battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Easy to Play, Tough to Master</strong> – Great for kids, teens, and seasoned shooter fans. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>FPS or TPS – Your Call</strong> – Swap between first- and third-person at any moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Abilities That Flip the Fight</strong> – Dash, double jump, and shield your way to victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃 <strong>No Time to Hide</strong> – Keep moving or fall behind. This game doesn’t reward campers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Outplay, Outshoot, Outscore</strong> – Fast decisions and sharper aim make the difference. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥇 <strong>Live Leaderboards</strong> – Track eliminations in real-time and fight to stay on top. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ DON’T PLAY SAFE. PLAY TO WIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping won’t help. Hiding won’t save you. <br> You want that <strong>#1 spot</strong>? Then you’ve got to fight for it. <br> <strong>Outplay. Outshoot. Outspeed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 COMING SOON</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Tournaments</strong> – Compete in <strong>high-stakes events</strong> to prove you're the best and earn exclusive rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛏️ <strong>Private Rooms</strong> – Create custom matches just for your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎫 <strong>Game Pass System</strong> – Unlock exclusive cosmetics, rewards and host or join private matches with game passes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌍 Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available in <strong>English</strong>.<br> More languages are coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏁 THE CLOCK IS TICKING. THE PAINT IS FLYING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast. Shoot smart. Rule the chaos.</strong> </p>", "short_description": "Paintball Madness is a super fun, fast game where you play paintball with friends. Pick a mode-play all by yourself (Free-for-All) try to grab the other team’s flag (Capture the Flag) or team up to win battles (Team Deathmatch). The faster you move, the more you win, have fun and no place to hide.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/f69207ec0c4432483e1c0ba18a7c08a5225da193/header.jpg?t=1786711410", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/1aef22a4a3f8996add5d457ee9ed5c02fc1fe934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786711410", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/1aef22a4a3f8996add5d457ee9ed5c02fc1fe934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786711410", "website": "https://www.cowparadisegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel (R) Core (TM) i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel (R) Core (TM) i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "ext_user_a